Removal control for tuxxy/tbtc-v2#24: refuses an ordinary deposit-only sweep
only while the reservation is in state Reserved; once it is TimeoutPending
(or Quarantined) the old deposit-only credit beside the reserved main is
accepted again. Never applied in the committed tree.

diff --git a/solidity/contracts/frost/FrostDepositSweep.sol b/solidity/contracts/frost/FrostDepositSweep.sol
--- a/solidity/contracts/frost/FrostDepositSweep.sol
+++ b/solidity/contracts/frost/FrostDepositSweep.sol
@@ -387,7 +387,13 @@
         require(
             request.includeMain ||
                 balance.mainOutpoint == bytes32(0) ||
-                balance.activeReservation != bytes32(0),
+                (balance.activeReservation != bytes32(0) &&
+                    bridge
+                        .frostRedemptions
+                        .ledger
+                        .intents[balance.activeReservation]
+                        .state !=
+                    FrostRedemptionLedger.IntentState.Reserved),
             "FROST sweep main required"
         );
         if (request.includeMain)
